# Datamaps Environment Configuration
#
# This project does not require secret environment variables.
# The following options can be set via global variables or build tool configuration:

# D3.js version - automatically resolved from package.json dependencies
# TOPOJSON version - automatically resolved from package.json dependencies

# To run tests:
#   npm test

# To lint:
#   npm run lint

# To build:
#   npm run build (via grunt)